==English==

===Alternative spellings===
* [[passerby]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|passers-by}}

# A person who is [[pass by|passing by]] (that is, walking past).
#: ''When he tripped and fell in the street, several kind '''passers-by''' helped him up.''

